<title>FRANCE: French raw steel output down 7.3 pct y/y in Sept.</title>
<headline>French raw steel output down 7.3 pct y/y in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>French raw steel production fell 7.3 percent in September, compared with the same month of last year, to 1.472 million tonnes, the French Steel Federation said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Cumulative production for the first nine months of the year was 12.956 million tonnes, or 7.8 percent less than for the same period of 1995, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
